question:
What is the output of the following C code snippet?
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int a = 10, *p = &a, **pp = &p;
    printf("%d", **pp + 5);
    return 0;
}
```

What is the output of the following C code?
```c
#define SQUARE(x) x * x
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int res = SQUARE(2 + 3);
    printf("%d", res);
    return 0;
}
```

What will be the output of the following C code?
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main() {
    int x = 1;
    switch(x) {
        case 1: printf("A");
        case 2: printf("B");
        default: printf("C");
    }
    return 0;
}
```
